^green;Hold [ALT-FIRE] to parry.^white;
^yellow;Riposte: 100hp blocking power with 0.6s Perfect Parry.^reset;
^yellow;Hook: 2nd attack hooks enemies closer.^reset;

''When you live next to death... you don't think about it anymore, you just try to encounter it as seldom as possible.''

^green;Imperial Hardship: 3x damage on first strike | All attacks afflict BOSS-BLEED against [GiC] Bosses.^white;

^#D6DFFF;War Cry: [SHIFT] to gain +90% DMG RES for 7s | 40s cooldown.

Magical bolts that can be loaded onto a crossbow. Unlike the Magic Arrow counterpart, ^#D6AF8B;these fly perfectly straight at a slow speed for a distance before suddenly losing all of its lethality and energy.^reset;

DMG: 100 PSYCHIC.

^#B4DB72;Spiritual Synergy: Crits deal +100 PSYCHIC DMG.

''It ain't magic if it ain't flashy. Danmaku's all about firepower.''

Kirsch is a clear, colourless brandy from Germany, Switzerland and France, traditionally made from double distillation of morello cherries, a dark-coloured cultivar of the sour cherry.

^#CC8A4D;Magic Bomb - When SECOND CHANCE is triggered, rapidly fire danmaku shots for up to 15s | Beverage effect expires on trigger | 30 minute duration.^reset;

''The vessel that'll store all my sorrows... Another round on me, lads!''

^orange;UNLOCKS: Conversion of [GiC] Empty Glass Bottle into a [Vanilla] Bottle at [Hand-Crafting] if not already unlocked.^reset;

This also unlocks any crafting recipes that directly produce [Vanilla] Bottle.

''Fully-digital currency has no basis in a society that has yet to achieve post-scarcity.''
It's said that pixels are a universal currency. Many human colonies outside of the core systems surrounding Sol do not officially recognize Pixels as valid currency. Such a notion stems from the Augmented Reality of Pixels, and that to most extrasolar humans, currency requires some physical basis for rarity.
^orange;Interact to decompress and yield 1k Pixels.^reset;

A refined Yari with additional rope wrapped around the shaft to retrieve the spear if thrown. Whilst powerful in the hands of the skilled, one mustn't forget that wars are not won by individuals alone.

^green;Noble Heritage: Hold and release [SHIFT] to throw the spear | When thrown, deal 100 damage base with piercing capabilities.^reset;
^green;Return Eternal: While thrown, press [SHIFT] to forcibly recall the spear.^reset;

''The forest has given us life and nourished us. We will hold this debt all our lives, until our blood nourishes the forest once more.''
^green;Hold [SHIFT] to parry.^reset;
^yellow;2x fists required for combos. Effect depends on fist that hit TGT.^reset;
^orange;Standing: Light-Light-Heavy^reset; | ^orange;Crouched: Light-Heavy^reset;
^orange;[BLOCK] + [LIGHT] to perform a [STUN BASH]^reset;
^yellow;35HP STABILITY^reset; | ^green;Perfect-Parries regenerate HP.^reset;
^orange;[HEAVY] attacks proc [REND-BLEED] on [STUNNED] targets.^reset;

''Despite what people might say, laws are not made to be broken. They can, however, be interpreted, elided, even wilfully misunderstood. Any law can be circumvented in the right circumstances--even the laws of the Death Judge herself.''
^#BCBC87;Sinner's Retribution: Confers alternative rewards if dealing the killing blow on THE TYRANT JUDGE.
^#D6DFFF;Slashing Counter-Attack: [SHIFT] to initiate COUNTER-ATTACK. If hit while performing the attack, counter with a strong downslash that afflicts ^orange;LOCKED-ON^#D6DFFF; for 3s, reducing the target's ^orange;DMG RES by -100%^reset;

A poor man's imitation of a 'sword'. This cleaver relies on weight for its power; an inelegant solution to man's problems. 

^yellow;Amanojaku: One-handed.^white;
^green;Dishonored: 4x damage on first strike. Heavy knockback on final attack.^white;

''I must be strong, even in this blasted wasteland my faith will overcome. I am unconquerable, yes. Yes, I am. I must be.'' ^green;Hold SHIFT to parry^white;.

^yellow;Precision Strikes: Thrust Attacks deal 1.5x damage, but low knockback.^white;
^green;Eternal Guard: 150hp blocking power.^white;
^green;Blessed Strike: Final strike deals 2x damage and tremendous knockback.^white;

A versatile weapon combining a spear and axe, allowing for precise thrusts and wide sweeping attacks. While swords and shorter blades are more suited for close-quarters, the Halberd offers control on open fields. ^green;Hold [ALT-FIRE] to parry.^white;
^yellow;Soldier's Resolve: 0.4s PARRY WINDOW | 150HP STABILITY.^white;
^orange;Shinobi Hunter: SHIFT to use the shaft to bash nearby targets, stunning them for two seconds.^reset;
^#D6DFFF;Tarry Not: Final strike deals 3s of additional bleed damage against [GiC] bosses.^white;

